B.a3U=new A.qL("Reading (20 soru) + Diyalog (5) + Restatement (4) + Paragraf/Anlam Bozan (9) = Toplam 38 soru (47.5 puan)! Bu \xfcnite seni 60 band\u0131ndan 70-80+ band\u0131na ta\u015f\u0131r.","Hedef: Reading'de kelime \xe7evirme tuza\u011f\u0131ndan kurtulup KANIT c\xfcmlesini avlamak!",B.Lt)
B.b7=new A.fy("Reading (Paragraf)","Reading",20,14,6,"reading")
B.i_=new A.ms(4,"readingPassage")
B.Lg=A.a(s(["It proved that the brain completely shuts down at night to save energy.","It showed that the earlier view of sleep as passive was mistaken because certain brain circuits stay active.","It revealed that seven hours of sleep is excessive for university students.","It confirmed that memories are permanently stored only inside the hippocampus."]),t.s)
B.pf=A.a(s(["For decades, sleep was widely viewed as a passive state during which the brain simply shut down to conserve energy.","However, modern neuroimaging has refuted this assumption, revealing that specific neural circuits remain remarkably active throughout the night.","During slow-wave deep sleep, the hippocampus replays newly acquired memories and transfers them to the neocortex for long-term storage.","Consequently, students who stay awake all night cramming before an exam retain far less information than peers who sleep seven to eight hours."]),t.s)
B.Os=A.a(s(["However","Consequently","For decades"]),t.s)
B.Pl=A.a(s(["v_refute"]),t.s)
B.I3=new A.aH("u5_l1_e1",B.i_,B.b7,"According to the passage, what has modern neuroimaging demonstrated about sleep?",null,B.Lg,1,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,"Why the Brain Needs Deep Sleep",B.pf,1,B.Os,B.d,'"However" ba\u011flac\u0131yla ba\u015flayan 2. c\xfcmleye odaklan! "Refuted" = \xe7\xfcr\xfctt\xfc!','2. c\xfcmlede "modern neuroimaging has refuted this assumption, revealing that specific neural circuits remain remarkably active" diyor \u2192 B \u015f\u0131kk\u0131 bunun birebir parafraz\u0131d\u0131r!',"Reading Kan\u0131t Av\u0131",B.Pl)
B.P_=A.a(s(["strengthens the transfer of memories to the neocortex","is less effective for memory retention than getting adequate sleep","eliminates the need for slow-wave deep sleep entirely","helps students conserve neural energy during exams"]),t.s)
B.ME=A.a(s(["However","Consequently"]),t.s)
B.I4=new A.aH("u5_l1_e2",B.i_,B.b7,"It can be inferred from the passage that pulling an all-nighter before a test ----.",null,B.P_,1,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,"Why the Brain Needs Deep Sleep",B.pf,3,B.ME,B.d,'"Consequently" (Sonu\xe7 olarak) ile ba\u015flayan son c\xfcmleye bak!','Son c\xfcmlede sabahlayan \xf6\u011frencilerin uyuyan akranlar\u0131na k\u0131yasla "far less information" (\xe7ok daha az bilgi) tuttu\u011fu vurgulan\u0131yor \u2192 B \u015f\u0131kk\u0131!',"Sonu\xe7 Ba\u011flac\u0131 \u0130pucu",B.d)
B.Pu=A.a(s([B.I3,B.I4]),t.g)
