B.M5=A.a(s(["Yes, traffic engineers unanimously agree that extra lanes solve congestion permanently.","Paradoxically, urban transport studies show that expanding highways rarely reduces traffic in the long run.","I never drive during rush hour because public buses are too expensive.","The construction project was canceled last winter due to heavy snow."]),t.s)
B.Pk=A.a(s(["v_paradoxically"]),t.s)
B.IA=new A.aH("u5_l2_e1",B.L,B.mw,'D\u0130YALOG:\nSelin: "I heard the municipality plans to widen the ring road to eliminate rush-hour jams."\nMert: "----"\nSelin: "Really? You mean building extra lanes actually draws even more cars onto the road?"',null,B.M5,1,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,null,B.d,null,B.d,B.d,'Bo\u015fluktan SONRAK\u0130 Selin repli\u011fine bak! "Ger\xe7ekten mi? Yani ekstra \u015ferit daha fazla araba m\u0131 \xe7ekiyor?"',"Diyalog alt\u0131n kural\u0131: Cevap daima bo\u015fluktan SONRAK\u0130 c\xfcmlenin tepkisinde gizlidir! Selin \u015fa\u015f\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131na g\xf6re Mert yol geni\u015fletmenin trafi\u011fi \xe7\xf6zmedi\u011fini s\xf6ylemi\u015f olmal\u0131 \u2192 B!","Sonraki Replik Kural\u0131",B.Pk)
B.Pw=A.a(s(["Offshore wind turbines are too expensive to produce any meaningful environmental benefit.","Although offshore wind turbines require considerable expenditure, their lasting ecological advantages render them a practical energy option.","Because offshore wind turbines cost very little, governments are rapidly abandoning solar power.","Offshore wind turbines are the only renewable source that benefits the marine environment."]),t.s)
B.Mo=A.a(s(["v_substantial","c_despite","c_although"]),t.s)
B.HN=new A.aH("u5_l2_e2",B.L,B.dS,'RESTATEMENT (Anlamca En Yak\u0131n):\n"Despite the substantial cost of offshore wind turbines, their long-term environmental benefits make them a viable energy source."',null,B.Pw,1,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,null,B.d,null,B.d,B.d,"E\u015f anlam e\u015fle\u015ftir: Despite = Although | substantial cost = considerable expenditure | viable = practical!",'B \u015f\u0131kk\u0131 t\xfcm anahtar kavramlar\u0131 eksiksiz ve abart\u0131s\u0131z parafraz ediyor (D \u015f\u0131kk\u0131 "only" diyerek a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 u\xe7 tuza\u011f\u0131na d\xfc\u015ft\xfc!).',"E\u015f Anlam D\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcm\xfc",B.Mo)
B.P1=A.a(s(["Biologists discovered cells long before the microscope appeared in the 17th century.","The 17th-century invention of the microscope prevented biologists from studying tissues.","Biologists remained unaware that living tissues are made up of cells until the microscope was invented in the 17th century.","Once cells were discovered, 17th-century scientists decided to invent the microscope."]),t.s)
B.If=new A.aH("u5_l2_e3",B.L,B.dS,'RESTATEMENT (Anlamca En Yak\u0131n):\n"Not until the microscope was invented in the 17th century did biologists realize that living tissues consist of cells."',null,B.P1,2,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,null,B.d,null,B.d,B.d,'"Not until X did Y happen" = X olana kadar Y ger\xe7ekle\u015fmedi (Y fark\u0131nda de\u011fildi)!','C \u015f\u0131kk\u0131: "remained unaware ... until the microscope was invented" = mikroskop icat edilene kadar fark\u0131nda de\u011fillerdi. Nokta at\u0131\u015f\u0131!',"Not Until Kal\u0131b\u0131",B.d)
B.Nr=A.a(s([B.IA,B.HN,B.If]),t.g)
B.L1=new A.cC("u5_l2",5,"Diyalog & Restatement","chat",40,!1,B.Nr)
