B.Lk=A.a(s(["(I) Honeybees communicate the distance and direction of nectar sources through an intricate movement known as the waggle dance.","(II) By adjusting the angle of this dance relative to the sun, a returning forager guides her hive mates with remarkable accuracy.","(III) Commercial honey exports from South America reached a record volume during the last fiscal quarter.","(IV) Furthermore, the duration of the waggle phase indicates exactly how far the flowers lie from the colony.","(V) Scientists studying this biological code have even designed swarm robots inspired by bee navigation."]),t.s)
B.I2=new A.aH("u5_l3_e1",B.os,B.dT,"Bu 5 c\xfcmleden hangisi paragraf\u0131n anlam b\xfct\xfcnl\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfc bozan \u0130MPOSTOR?",null,B.d,2,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,null,B.d,null,B.d,B.Lk,'Konu "bal ar\u0131lar\u0131" ama ALT KONU ne? (I, II, IV, V: ar\u0131lar\u0131n ileti\u015fim dans\u0131. Peki III ne anlat\u0131yor?)',"(III) numaral\u0131 c\xfcmle aniden G\xfcney Amerika'n\u0131n bal ihracat rakamlar\u0131na s\u0131\xe7rayarak ar\u0131 ileti\u015fimi ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 bozdu! \u0130mpostor yakaland\u0131!","Alt Konu Kopuklu\u011fu",B.d)
B.Nu=A.a(s(["(I) Throughout human history, salt was far more than a simple seasoning; it was a vital preservative before refrigeration existed.","(II) Because salted meat and fish could be stored for months, ancient armies and maritime traders relied heavily on it.","(III) In fact, several Roman roads, including the famous Via Salaria, were constructed specifically to transport salt inland.","(IV) Excessive sodium consumption in modern fast-food diets is currently linked to hypertension worldwide.","(V) Control over salt mines therefore gave medieval kingdoms substantial economic and political leverage."]),t.s)
B.Il=new A.aH("u5_l3_e2",B.os,B.dT,"\u0130kinci \u0130mpostor Av\u0131! Ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 bozan c\xfcmleye dokun:",null,B.d,3,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,null,B.d,null,B.d,B.Nu,"Zaman s\u0131\xe7ramas\u0131na dikkat! 4 c\xfcmle TAR\u0130HTE tuzun \xf6nemini anlat\u0131yor; hangisi G\xdcN\xdcM\xdcZ sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131na s\u0131\xe7rad\u0131?","(IV) numaral\u0131 c\xfcmle antik/orta\xe7a\u011f tarihinden g\xfcn\xfcm\xfcz fast-food ve tansiyon sorununa s\u0131\xe7rayarak b\xfct\xfcnl\xfc\u011f\xfc bozdu! Ayr\u0131ca (V)'teki \"therefore\" (III)'e ba\u011flan\u0131r.","Zaman S\u0131\xe7ramas\u0131",B.d)
B.Pg=A.a(s(["Unlike soil and trees, these artificial surfaces release trapped heat slowly after sunset.","Rural agriculture has declined steadily since the industrial revolution.","Many medieval castles were originally built from local limestone.","Cold ocean currents bring thick fog to desert coastlines every winter."]),t.s)
B.HK=new A.aH("u5_l3_e3",B.L,B.dT,'PARAGRAF TAMAMLAMA:\n"Urban heat islands occur when concrete and asphalt absorb solar radiation far more intensely than natural vegetation. ---- As a result, nighttime temperatures in city centers can remain up to 4\xb0C warmer than in surrounding rural areas."',null,B.Pg,0,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,null,B.d,null,B.d,B.d,'Bo\u015fluktan SONRA "As a result, nighttime temperatures..." (Sonu\xe7 olarak GECE s\u0131cakl\u0131klar\u0131 y\xfcksek kal\u0131r) diyor!','A \u015f\u0131kk\u0131ndaki "these artificial surfaces" (concrete & asphalt\'a g\xf6nderme) + "release trapped heat slowly after sunset" (gece s\u0131cak kalmas\u0131n\u0131n do\u011frudan sebebi!) kusursuz k\xf6pr\xfc kuruyor!',"Reference + Sonu\xe7 K\xf6pr\xfcs\xfc",B.d)
B.P4=A.a(s([B.I2,B.Il,B.HK]),t.g)
