B.Nv=A.a(s(["Because bioplastics are actually made entirely from petroleum rather than plants.","Because many bioplastics require high-temperature industrial facilities to decompose quickly and persist in cold oceans.","Because cornstarch farming consumes less water than sugarcane cultivation.","Because regular petroleum plastics decompose faster than 60\xb0C in seawater."]),t.s)
B.pe=A.a(s(["Conventional petroleum-based plastics persist in landfills and oceans for centuries, prompting urgent searches for eco-friendly substitutes.","Bioplastics derived from cornstarch or sugarcane have emerged as a promising alternative because they can reduce reliance on fossil fuels.",'Nevertheless, environmental chemists caution that "biodegradable" labels can be misleading to consumers.',"Many commercial bioplastics break down rapidly only inside industrial composting facilities heated above 60\xb0C, meaning they degrade almost as slowly as regular plastic if tossed into cold seawater."]),t.s)
B.MW=A.a(s(["Nevertheless","because","if"]),t.s)
B.I9=new A.aH("u5_b_e1",B.i_,B.b7,'Why do environmental chemists warn that "biodegradable" bioplastic labels can mislead consumers?',null,B.Nv,1,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,"The Rise of Bioplastics",B.pe,3,B.MW,B.d,'"Nevertheless" uyar\u0131s\u0131ndan hemen sonraki 4. c\xfcmleyi oku (60\xb0C ve so\u011fuk deniz suyu)!',"4. c\xfcmlede pek \xe7ok biyoplasti\u011fin yaln\u0131zca 60\xb0C \xfczerindeki end\xfcstriyel tesislerde h\u0131zl\u0131 \xe7\xf6z\xfcnd\xfc\u011f\xfc, so\u011fuk denizde normal plastik kadar yava\u015f par\xe7aland\u0131\u011f\u0131 a\xe7\u0131k\xe7a belirtiliyor \u2192 B!","70+ Final Boss Reading",B.d)
