B.OX=A.a(s(["Coastal villages suffered heavy casualties because the warning buoys failed to work.","Thanks to the timely detection of the subsea tremor by warning buoys, coastal villages avoided much greater loss of life.","The underwater tremor was too weak to be noticed by coastal warning buoys.","Unless warning buoys are upgraded, future underwater tremors will destroy every village."]),t.s)
B.Ic=new A.aH("u5_b_e3",B.L,B.dS,'F\u0130NAL SORUSU (Restatement):\n"Had the early warning buoys not detected the underwater tremor in time, coastal villages would have suffered far heavier casualties."',null,B.OX,1,B.B,null,null,null,B.d,null,B.d,null,B.d,B.d,'"Had ... not detected" = Devrik Type-3 Ko\u015ful (If they had not detected)! Yani \u015famand\u0131ralar ZAMANINDA TESP\u0130T ETT\u0130!','Type-3 devrik ko\u015ful ("Had X not happened, Y would have...") = X ger\xe7ekle\u015fti\u011fi i\xe7in Y engellendi \u2192 B \u015f\u0131kk\u0131! 70 Puan Final Boss\'unu devirdin!!',"C1 Devrik Ko\u015ful Zaferi",B.d)
