B.S6=new A.dl(B.mw,null,null,'Deniz: "Why are you memorizing English vocabulary with that spaced-repetition app instead of highlighting a notebook?"\nKaan: "----"\nDeniz: "That makes sense\u2014reviewing a word right before you forget it saves hours of pointless rereading."',B.Oq,2,'Deniz "unutmak \xfczereyken tekrar etmek mant\u0131kl\u0131ym\u0131\u015f" dedi\u011fine g\xf6re Kaan aral\u0131kl\u0131 tekrar algoritmas\u0131n\u0131n haf\u0131za silinmeden tam \xf6nce kart\u0131 getirdi\u011fini s\xf6ylemi\u015f olmal\u0131 \u2192 C!',"Diyalogda bo\u015fluktan sonraki c\xfcmle (Deniz) do\u011fru \u015f\u0131kk\u0131n \xf6zetidir!")
B.MN=A.a(s(["A) Astronomers have found clear signs of life on several newly discovered exoplanets.","B) Although astronomers have identified thousands of exoplanets, definitive evidence of life beyond Earth has not yet been found on any of them.","C) Because astronomers lack powerful telescopes, they have discovered very few exoplanets.","D) Only a handful of exoplanets have been examined for extraterrestrial life.","E) Astronomers no longer search for exoplanets since life cannot exist outside Earth."]),t.s)
