B.RZ=new A.dl(B.dT,null,null,"Historically, silk production was a closely guarded monopoly in ancient China for more than two millennia. ---- Once silkworm eggs and mulberry cultivation secrets were smuggled westward along the Silk Road, however, thriving textile workshops soon emerged in Byzantium and Persia.",B.OZ,0,'\xd6nce "closely guarded monopoly" (s\u0131k\u0131 korunan tekel), sonra "Once silkworm eggs were smuggled" (ka\xe7\u0131r\u0131l\u0131nca) geliyor \u2192 A \u015f\u0131kk\u0131 ipekb\xf6ce\u011fi yumurtas\u0131n\u0131 ka\xe7\u0131ranlar\u0131n a\u011f\u0131r cezaland\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yleyerek m\xfckemmel ba\u011f kuruyor!','\xd6nceki c\xfcmle ("s\u0131k\u0131 korunan") + sonraki c\xfcmle ("yumurtalar ka\xe7\u0131r\u0131l\u0131nca") aras\u0131ndaki k\xf6pr\xfcy\xfc bul!')
