B.RW=new A.dl(B.dT,null,null,"Which sentence disrupts the coherence of the paragraph?\n(I) Coffee was originally cultivated in the highlands of Ethiopia before spreading to Yemen in the fifteenth century. (II) Sufi scholars in Yemen brewed the roasted beans to stay alert during lengthy nighttime prayers. (III) From Arabian ports, coffeehouses rapidly expanded to Cairo, Damascus, and Istanbul, becoming lively centers of intellectual debate. (IV) Modern espresso machines rely on nine bars of water pressure to extract aromatic oils in under thirty seconds. (V) By the late seventeenth century, this stimulating beverage had reached London and Vienna, transforming European social life.",B.Pp,3,"(I, II, III, V) kahvenin 15.-17. y\xfczy\u0131llardaki tarihsel yay\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 kronolojik olarak anlat\u0131rken, (IV) aniden modern espresso makinelerinin 9 bar bas\u0131nc\u0131na s\u0131\xe7rayarak ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 bozar \u2192 D!","Kronoloji ve zaman s\u0131\xe7ramas\u0131 (15.-17. yy \u2192 modern espresso makinesi) impostoru ele verir!")
