B.a4l=new A.aU("pv_cope_with","cope with","Phrasal Verb","ba\u015fa \xe7\u0131kmak, \xfcstesinden gelmek","deal with, handle, manage","cope with stress / challenges","Desert plants have evolved waxy leaves to cope with extreme water scarcity.","\xc7\xf6l bitkileri a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 su k\u0131tl\u0131\u011f\u0131yla ba\u015fa \xe7\u0131kmak i\xe7in mumsu yapraklar geli\u015ftirmi\u015ftir.",'Challenge, stress, crisis, demand varsa "cope with"e g\xf6z k\u0131rp.',1,B.G)
