B.a4W=new A.aU("c_although","although / even though","Connector","-e ra\u011fmen, -sa da (ZITLIK + TAM C\xdcMLE)","though, even if (ko\u015ful-z\u0131tl\u0131k)","Although + Subject + Verb","Although solar panels require high initial investment, they cut energy bills drastically.","G\xfcne\u015f panelleri y\xfcksek ilk yat\u0131r\u0131m gerektirse de enerji faturalar\u0131n\u0131 b\xfcy\xfck \xf6l\xe7\xfcde d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr.","ALTIN KURAL: Arkas\u0131ndan mutlaka \xd6ZNE + F\u0130\u0130L (tam c\xfcmle) gelir! \u0130sim gelirse Despite se\xe7.",2,B.ai)
B.a4y=new A.aU("c_despite","despite / in spite of","Connector","-e ra\u011fmen (ZITLIK + \u0130S\u0130M \xd6BE\u011e\u0130)","notwithstanding, regardless of","Despite + Noun / V-ing (ASLA tam c\xfcmle de\u011fil!)","Despite strict regulations, illegal logging still threatens tropical rainforests.","Kat\u0131 d\xfczenlemelere ra\u011fmen yasa d\u0131\u015f\u0131 a\u011fa\xe7 kesimi h\xe2l\xe2 tropikal ya\u011fmur ormanlar\u0131n\u0131 tehdit ediyor.","Bo\u015fluktan sonra fiil yoksa (sadece isim/s\u0131fat tamlamas\u0131 varsa) 2 saniyede Despite/In spite of se\xe7!",2,B.ai)
B.a4D=new A.aU("c_whereas","whereas / while","Connector","oysa, -iken (KAR\u015eILA\u015eTIRMALI ZITLIK)","whilst, in contrast to (isim)","X does A, whereas Y does B","Some reptiles lay dozens of eggs, whereas mammals invest heavily in fewer offspring.","Baz\u0131 s\xfcr\xfcngenler onlarca yumurta b\u0131rak\u0131rken, memeliler daha az yavruya yo\u011fun yat\u0131r\u0131m yapar.","\u0130ki farkl\u0131 \xf6zne (X vs Y) k\u0131yaslan\u0131yorsa cevap neredeyse her zaman Whereas/While!",2,B.ai)
B.a4L=new A.aU("c_however","however / nevertheless","Connector","ancak, yine de, buna kar\u015f\u0131n","nonetheless, yet, still, conversely","Sentence 1; however, Sentence 2.","The drug showed promising lab results; nevertheless, human trials proved inconclusive.","\u0130la\xe7 laboratuvarda umut verici sonu\xe7lar verdi; yine de insan deneyleri kesin sonu\xe7 vermedi.","Noktalama tuza\u011f\u0131: Genellikle nokta (.) veya noktal\u0131 virg\xfcl (;) + virg\xfcl (,) aras\u0131nda durur!",2,B.ai)
B.a4c=new A.aU("c_due_to","due to / owing to","Connector","-den dolay\u0131, y\xfcz\xfcnden (SEBEP + \u0130S\u0130M)","because of, on account of, as a result of","due to + Noun / V-ing","Several flights were canceled due to dense fog around the runway.","Pist \xe7evresindeki yo\u011fun sis nedeniyle birka\xe7 u\xe7u\u015f iptal edildi.","Because (+ C\xfcmle) \u2194 Due to / Owing to (+ \u0130sim). \xd6SYM'nin en klasik eleme sorusu!",2,B.ai)
B.a47=new A.aU("c_therefore","therefore / consequently","Connector","bu y\xfczden, dolay\u0131s\u0131yla, sonu\xe7 olarak","thus, hence, as a consequence","Cause; therefore, Effect.","Antibiotics do not target viruses; therefore, they are ineffective against the common cold.","Antibiyotikler vir\xfcsleri hedef almaz; bu y\xfczden so\u011fuk alg\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131 etkisizdirler.","Sebep \u2192 Sonu\xe7 ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 (+ \u2192 + veya - \u2192 -). Paragrafta sonu\xe7 c\xfcmlesini ele verir!",2,B.ai)
B.a4s=new A.aU("c_unless","unless","Connector","-medik\xe7e, -mazsa (OLUMSUZ KO\u015eUL)","if ... not","Unless + olumlu c\xfcmle (= If not)","Carbon emissions will keep climbing unless nations accelerate clean energy transitions.","\xdclkeler temiz enerji ge\xe7i\u015fini h\u0131zland\u0131rmad\u0131k\xe7a karbon sal\u0131mlar\u0131 artmaya devam edecek.","Unless kendi i\xe7inde olumsuzdur; yan\u0131ndaki c\xfcmle genelde OLUMLU fiil ta\u015f\u0131r!",2,B.ai)
B.a5_=new A.aU("c_provided_that","provided that / as long as","Connector","...\u015fart\u0131yla, -d\u0131\u011f\u0131 s\xfcrece (KO\u015eUL)","on condition that, providing that","Result + provided that + Condition","Coral reefs can recover gradually provided that ocean temperatures stabilize.","Okyanus s\u0131cakl\u0131klar\u0131 dengelenmek \u015fart\u0131yla mercan resifleri kademeli olarak toparlanabilir.",'Sadece ko\u015ful bildirir (if e\u015fde\u011feri); akademik metinlerde "if" yerine bay\u0131larak kullan\u0131l\u0131r.',2,B.ai)
