B.a4O=new A.aU("p_result_in_from","result in / result from","Prep Collocation","result IN: yol a\xe7mak | result FROM: kaynaklanmak","lead to (in) / stem from (from)","Cause results IN Effect | Effect results FROM Cause","Poor ventilation can result in fatigue, whereas headaches often result from dehydration.","Yetersiz havaland\u0131rma yorgunlu\u011fa yol a\xe7abilir; oysa ba\u015f a\u011fr\u0131lar\u0131 s\u0131k s\u0131k susuzluktan kaynaklan\u0131r.","\xd6SYM BAYILIR: IN = i\xe7ine/sonucuna g\xf6t\xfcr\xfcr, FROM = sebebinden (-den) gelir!",3,B.ay)
B.a4a=new A.aU("p_prevent_from","prevent / deter from","Prep Collocation","-den al\u0131koymak, engellemek","stop from, prohibit from, hinder from","prevent X FROM + V-ing","Early warning sirens prevented thousands of residents from entering the flood zone.","Erken uyar\u0131 sirenleri binlerce sakinin sel b\xf6lgesine girmesini engelledi.","Engelleme fiillerinin tamam\u0131 FROM + V-ing ile e\u015fle\u015fir!",3,B.ay)
